cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data products, please cite it as below."
title: "cropyield-uganda: crop-yield prediction from agroclimatic factors in Uganda"
abstract: >-
  District- and subregion-level crop-yield prediction for Uganda built on
  UBOS Annual Agricultural Survey statistics (AAS 2018, AAS 2020), CHIRPS
  rainfall, NASA POWER temperature, and C3S soil-moisture data, with PCA and
  regression comparisons under spatial and temporal validation.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Uganda Crop-Yield Research Project"
date-released: "2026-07-31"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://example.invalid/cropyield-uganda"
keywords:
  - crop yield
  - Uganda
  - AAS
  - CHIRPS
  - PCA
  - remote sensing
